<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>BGTaskSchedulerPermittedIdentifiers</key>
	<array>
		<string>com.maxenceyu.floweroll.runtime.continued.*</string>
		<string>com.maxenceyu.floweroll.runtime.recovery</string>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>$(DEVELOPMENT_LANGUAGE)</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>花卷</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleURLTypes</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>CFBundleURLName</key>
			<string>com.maxenceyu.floweroll.task</string>
			<key>CFBundleURLSchemes</key>
			<array>
				<string>floweroll</string>
			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSAlarmKitUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷需要使用系统闹钟，在你明确要求时创建并核验定时提醒。</string>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
	<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷按你的指令查看必要日程与空闲时间，并在你确认后添加日程、读回核对保存结果。</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只在你主动拍照或扫描文档时使用相机。</string>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只在你明确要求时访问当前允许的联系人，用于查找、创建或修改姓名和联系方式，并在保存后核对结果。</string>
	<key>NSLocationAlwaysAndWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只会在你明确交代且任务确实需要当前位置时，在后台读取一次当前位置来继续任务；不会持续跟踪，也不会保存位置历史。</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只会在你明确交代且任务确实需要当前位置时，读取一次当前位置来完成这次任务。</string>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只在你主动输入语音或开始观察时使用麦克风，转写所选声音并整理记录。</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷只会在你明确点击“保存到照片”时，把已验证的图片成果添加到系统照片图库。</string>
	<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
	<string>花卷需要访问提醒事项，才能在你明确授权后创建、读取并核验你交代的提醒任务。</string>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivities</key>
	<true/>
	<key>NSSupportsLiveActivitiesFrequentUpdates</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>screen-capture</string>
		<string>audio</string>
		<string>processing</string>
	</array>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
